          %p
            %strong Quantum linear groups
            are
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Hopf+algebras"} Hopf algebras
            which are quantum deformations of Hopf algebras of coordinate functions on the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/general+linear+group"} general linear group
            or
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/special+linear+group"} special linear group
            = succeed "s." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/matrix+Hopf+algebra"} matrix Hopf algebra
          %p
            The usual notation for one-parametric versions is
            = succeed "," do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
